 ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
+- `shop list --limit N` to show only the first N products.
 - `shop export --format tsv` for exporting orders as tab-separated values (handles commas in customer names).
 - `shop export --format markdown` for exporting orders as a markdown table.
 - `shop report` now includes a TOTAL row at the bottom showing total items and total amount.
